032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐忆刘玉渊 其二","author":"白玉蟾","text":"夜已三更忽坐忘，吟魂醉魄政悠扬。\n孤鸿见召听寒角，残月相辞过粉墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25426,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐忆刘玉渊 其一","author":"白玉蟾","text":"多多泻酒愁无况，久久吟诗淡有情。\n花作雪飞深一寸，月随云上恰三更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25427,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜深","author":"白玉蟾","text":"一晚寻思未得诗，楼前只有月相知。\n夜深欲睡还贪坐，坐到五更钟动时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25428,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜醉","author":"白玉蟾","text":"鼕鼕珰珰珰，烂醉如泥了。\n睡至谷谷呱，东窗梅影晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25429,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉酬臞庵李侍郎 其一","author":"白玉蟾","text":"坐对梅花撚白须，吟边有酒不须酤。\n松窗昨夜冰生砚，冻合银床读易朱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25430,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉酬臞庵李侍郎 其二","author":"白玉蟾","text":"南枝才放两三花，雪里吹香弄粉些。\n淡淡著烟浓著月，深深笼水浅笼沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25431,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉酬臞庵李侍郎 其五","author":"白玉蟾","text":"酒红沁面晕成霞，笑撚吟髭数暮鸦。\n不入朝廷鸳鹭侣，自甘白发插梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25432,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉酬臞庵李侍郎 其四","author":"白玉蟾","text":"满月世界琉璃光，通宵不寐据胡床。\n语言玉润篇篇锦，心胆冰清字字香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉酬臞庵李侍郎 其三","author":"白玉蟾","text":"全是山林居士风，不知位重更官穹。\n名书玉几金瓯内，心在蒲团纸帐中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25434,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤萤","author":"白玉蟾","text":"夜静乘凉坐水亭，草头隐映见孤萤。\n瞥然飞过银塘面，俯仰浮光几点星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25435,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤凝","author":"白玉蟾","text":"筠皮月静铺金屑，仙掌云寒砌玉花。\n人在华胥初梦断，乱山满目一声鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25436,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝慈寺","author":"白玉蟾","text":"殿古涵烟冷，楼空得月多。\n钟声巡远岫，塔影卧清波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25437,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岩下闻鸦","author":"白玉蟾","text":"行绕松林不见鸦，只疑山后噪查查。\n更移数步俄回首，缩脰蹲身立树丫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25438,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招贤道士","author":"白玉蟾","text":"解鞍默默对斜晖，无限诗怀在翠微。\n一句秋鸿来入耳，两行客泪下沾衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25439,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"易道录招饮 其五","author":"白玉蟾","text":"名于瑚琏斯为贵，身与鸿毛孰较轻。\n诗社近来多笔冢，醉乡何处得愁城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25440,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"易道录招饮 其四","author":"白玉蟾","text":"诗疵得似维摩病，酒圣能如孟子醇。\n何事多时疏杖屦，亦缘避俗屏冠巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25441,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"易道录招饮 其三","author":"白玉蟾","text":"素白见招真慷慨，苍黄欲赴又趑趄。\n命存一定百年见，事要十全千古无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"易道录招饮 其二","author":"白玉蟾","text":"诗酒交游如骨肉，江湖聚散似云萍。\n已烦鹤唳供头盏，且借岚光作画屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]